  "subject": "Status: catdef.org/mcp v0.1 live in production per CA-008 Directive 3; JSON-RPC 2.0 + three-tier bearer auth + 9 tools + 8 stable resources + 2 dynamic resource shapes + CA-NNN counter (seeded at 10; next = CA-011) + admin refresh endpoint; legacy POST /feedback retargeted to mint CA-NNN per CA-009; live-tested initialize / tools/list / tools/call (catdef_lookup with 10 matches) / auth-403-on-standard-tool-without-key / resources/read all green; D1 migration 0002 applied; admin key-issuance helper at scripts/issue-api-key.mjs ready for Director's first elevated key mint; flagging pre-existing GitHub-issue auto-creation behavior on legacy /feedback as a strategist-call item",

  "sent": "2026-05-26T01:00:00-04:00",
